      "english": "“If you take off your shoes, you won’t be afraid of her.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "不过谢谢你，我现在一点都不紧张了！”",
      "traditional": "不過謝謝你，我現在一點都不緊張了！”",
