      "traditional": "如果你什麼都沒有，就不用擔心失去什麼東西，膽子也會更大。",
      "pinyin": "rú guǒ nǐ shén me dōu méi yǒu jiù bú yòng dān xīn shī qù shén me dōng xi dǎn zi yě huì gèng dà",
      "english": "In fact, \"a person who walks around barefoot is not afraid of people wearing shoes\" means:"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "If you don’t have anything, you don’t need to worry about losing anything, and you will be more courageous."
